```
<button id="dark">Dark mode</button>

JS:

const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');
if (savedTheme === 'dark') {
  document.body.classList.add('dark');
}

document.getElementById('dark').addEventListener('click', () => {
  document.body.classList.add('dark');
  localStorage.setItem('theme', 'dark');
});
```

